                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16760782" author="agoncharuk" created="Tue, 5 Feb 2019 13:08:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After allowing the node failed event to be processed by exchange, an assertion appeared. The cause of the assertion is second call to merge exchanges from &lt;tt&gt;onAllReceived&lt;/tt&gt;. If node left event is completing merge phase, need to call &lt;tt&gt;finishExchangeOnCoordinator&lt;/tt&gt; rather that &lt;tt&gt;onAllReceived&lt;/tt&gt; to skip second merge step.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16761076" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 5 Feb 2019 18:14:03 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
